{"RukuNumber":135,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":109,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ ٱلۡمَلَأُ مِن قَوۡمِ فِرۡعَوۡنَ إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَسَٰحِرٌ عَلِيمٞ","TajweedText":"قَالَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَلَأُ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َوْمِ فِرْعَوْنَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا لَسَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>حِرٌ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>١٠٩</span>","End":"١٠٩","PageNumber":164,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":65,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":110,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يُرِيدُ أَن يُخۡرِجَكُم مِّنۡ أَرۡضِكُمۡۖ فَمَاذَا تَأۡمُرُونَ","TajweedText":"يُرِيدُ أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>ُخْرِجَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْ أَرْضِكُمْ‌ۖ فَمَاذَا تَأْمُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١٠</span>","End":"١١٠","PageNumber":164,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":65,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":111,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ أَرۡجِهۡ وَأَخَاهُ وَأَرۡسِلۡ فِي ٱلۡمَدَآئِنِ حَٰشِرِينَ","TajweedText":"قَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَرْجِهْ وَأَخَاهُ وَأَرْسِلْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَد<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِنِ حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>شِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١١</span>","End":"١١١","PageNumber":164,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":65,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":112,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَ