_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١٧</span>","End":"١١٧","PageNumber":164,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":66,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":118,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَوَقَعَ ٱلۡحَقُّ وَبَطَلَ مَا كَانُواْ يَعۡمَلُونَ","TajweedText":"فَوَقَعَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقُّ وَبَطَلَ مَا كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يَعْمَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١٨</span>","End":"١١٨","PageNumber":164,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":66,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":119,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَغُلِبُواْ هُنَالِكَ وَٱنقَلَبُواْ صَٰغِرِينَ","TajweedText":"فَغُلِبُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> هُنَالِكَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نق</tajweed>َلَبُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>غِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١٩</span>","End":"١١٩","PageNumber":164,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":66,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":120,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأُلۡقِيَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ سَٰجِدِينَ","TajweedText":"وَأُلْقِىَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّحَرَةُ سَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>جِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٢٠</span>","End":"١٢٠","PageNumber":164,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":66,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":121,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ ءَامَنَّا بِرَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"قَال<