se,"Text":"لَأُقَطِّعَنَّ أَيۡدِيَكُمۡ وَأَرۡجُلَكُم مِّنۡ خِلَٰفٖ ثُمَّ لَأُصَلِّبَنَّكُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"لَأُقَطِّعَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ أَيْدِيَكُمْ وَأَرْجُلَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْ خِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>فٍ ث</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ لَأُصَلِّبَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٢٤</span>","End":"١٢٤","PageNumber":165,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":66,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":125,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّآ إِلَىٰ رَبِّنَا مُنقَلِبُونَ","TajweedText":"قَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَىٰ رَبِّنَا مُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نق</tajweed>َلِب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٢٥</span>","End":"١٢٥","PageNumber":165,"JuzNumber":9,"ManzilNumber":2,"RukuNumber":135,"MaqraNumber":66,"HizbNumber":17,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":7,"SurahIndex":"007","VerseNumber":126,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا تَنقِمُ مِنَّآ إِلَّآ أَنۡ ءَامَنَّا بِـَٔايَٰتِ رَبِّنَا لَمَّا جَآءَتۡنَاۚ رَبَّنَآ أَفۡرِغۡ عَلَيۡنَا صَبۡرٗا وَتَوَفَّنَا مُسۡلِمِينَ","TajweedText":"وَمَا تَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نق</tajweed>ِمُ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَنْ ءَامَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا بِـَٔـايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ رَبِّنَا لَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا ج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَتْنَا‌ۚ رَبَّن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَفْرِغ